# Security headers for the Bramble website.
#
# Cloudflare Workers parses this file out of the deployed asset directory and
# applies it to static-asset responses. It is not itself served as an asset.
# Vite copies public/ into dist/, so it ships with every build.
#
# Deliberately NOT set here:
#   Strict-Transport-Security and X-Content-Type-Options are configured at the
#   Cloudflare edge (SSL/TLS -> Edge Certificates). Setting them here as well
#   would emit them from two sources of truth; the edge is the one in use.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is split in two on purpose. The enforcing policy
# carries only directives that cannot break this site: it has no frames and no
# <base> element, so denying both costs nothing. The full policy ships
# report-only because a wrong script-src or style-src does not degrade a
# single-page app, it blanks it — so the violations get read from a browser
# console on every page before the policy is promoted to enforcing.
#
# The report-only policy was derived from the built output, not assumed:
# scripts, styles, fonts and images are all same-origin under /assets or /, the
# external hosts in the bundle (Chrome Web Store, GitHub, Starkscan) are link
# targets rather than fetches, and `data:` is allowed for images only because
# Vite inlines assets below its size threshold.
#
# form-action is in the report-only policy only. The support page has a real
# <form>, and although its onSubmit calls preventDefault() and navigates
# instead, enforcing form-action before observing it risks breaking the
# no-JavaScript submit path.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), bluetooth=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), idle-detection=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), screen-wake-lock=(), serial=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
